  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Narration places Su clan Gu Immortals deep within icy sea area in Eastern Sea, where a huge underwater mountain of thousand year profound ice fills their vision and cold chill permeates even their Immortal Gu House. Su clan sits close to icy sea area, and deep within this sea area there are abundant ice and snow immortal materials, which the clan plans to collect as profound ice for Fang Yuan’s water path resource demand.",
